        "name": "Basic Skysage Divination",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The stars move, granting you a sliver of their magic. Choose one of the following 1st-rank spells to your spell repertoire: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Object Reading] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sure Strike]. You can Cast this Spell as an occult Oatia skysage spell.</p>\n<p>At 6th level, choose one of the following 2nd-rank spells to add to your spell repertoire: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Augury] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.See the Unseen]. At 8th level, you choose one of the following 3rd-rank spells to add to your spell repertoire: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Clairaudience] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Locate].</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Oatia Skysage Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Adventure Path: Gatewalkers"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "archetype"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 4,
      "category": "class"
    },
